  "title": "Determinism coefficient",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "ffc0d130-5899-45bc-b250-e358210ee957",
      "text": "The determinism coefficient measures how reliably a state leads to a single future state: 1 when it leads to one future state with probability 1, and 0 when every future state is equally likely.",
